{"id":"154f028fc8ad4b75","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-mod-m-circuit.md","title":"Modular Gates and ACC0","display":"df-mod-m-circuit — Modular Gates and ACC0","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-mod-m-circuit","aliases":["28-df-mod-m-circuit"],"display":"df-mod-m-circuit — Modular Gates and ACC0","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-depth]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 14.3","source_printed_pages":"291","source_pdf_pages":"317","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-mod-m-circuit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-mod-m-circuit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mod-m-circuit — Modular Gates and ACC0"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" href=\"?note=f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" title=\"28-df-circuit-depth\">28-df-circuit-depth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 14.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"291"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"317"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_1,\\ldots,a_r\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a_1,\\ldots,a_r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec m=(m_1,\\ldots,m_k)\">\\(\\vec m=(m_1,\\ldots,m_k)\\)</span>，各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(m_i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\Gamma_n,\\operatorname{pred}_C\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\Gamma_n,\\operatorname{pred}_C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_\\wedge=\\mathsf{and},\\gamma_\\vee=\\mathsf{or},\\gamma_\\neg=\\mathsf{not}\">\\(\\gamma_\\wedge=\\mathsf{and},\\gamma_\\vee=\\mathsf{or},\\gamma_\\neg=\\mathsf{not}\\)</span> 为其既有门标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf M\">\\(\\mathsf M\\)</span> 是互异新增标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}\">\\(\\operatorname{depth}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" href=\"?note=f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" title=\"28-df-circuit-depth\">28-df-circuit-depth</a>。</li>\n<li>扩展候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)\">\\(C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\kappa\">\\(C^\\kappa\\)</span> 将标签按下式映回普通布尔电路，作为合法结构的判定接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>求值、输出及规模函数仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathcal C_{n,\\vec m}\">\\(C\\in\\mathcal C_{n,\\vec m}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span> 定义；空求和取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MOD}_m(a_1,\\ldots,a_r)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1\\left[\\sum_{j=1}^ra_j\\not\\equiv0\\pmod m\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MOD}_m(a_1,\\ldots,a_r)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1\\left[\\sum_{j=1}^ra_j\\not\\equiv0\\pmod m\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{n,\\vec m}\\coloneqq\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{(\\mathsf M,i):i\\in[k]\\},\\qquad\\kappa(t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\gamma_\\vee&amp;t=(\\mathsf M,i),\\ i\\in[k],\\\\t&amp;t\\in\\Gamma_n,\\end{cases}\\qquad C^\\kappa\\coloneqq(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\kappa\\circ\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma_{n,\\vec m}\\coloneqq\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{(\\mathsf M,i):i\\in[k]\\},\\qquad\\kappa(t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\gamma_\\vee&amp;t=(\\mathsf M,i),\\ i\\in[k],\\\\t&amp;t\\in\\Gamma_n,\\end{cases}\\qquad C^\\kappa\\coloneqq(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\kappa\\circ\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{n,\\vec m}\\coloneqq\\{C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau):\\tau:V\\to\\Gamma_{n,\\vec m},\\ C^\\kappa\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_{n,\\vec m}\\coloneqq\\{C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau):\\tau:V\\to\\Gamma_{n,\\vec m},\\ C^\\kappa\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_j&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j,\\\\b&amp;\\tau(v)=b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\\\1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\gamma_\\neg,\\ \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\{u\\},\\\\\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\gamma_\\wedge,\\\\1-\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}(1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u))&amp;\\tau(v)=\\gamma_\\vee,\\\\\\operatorname{MOD}_{m_i}((\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u))_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)})&amp;\\tau(v)=(\\mathsf M,i).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_j&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j,\\\\b&amp;\\tau(v)=b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\\\1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\gamma_\\neg,\\ \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\{u\\},\\\\\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\gamma_\\wedge,\\\\1-\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}(1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u))&amp;\\tau(v)=\\gamma_\\vee,\\\\\\operatorname{MOD}_{m_i}((\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u))_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)})&amp;\\tau(v)=(\\mathsf M,i).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_C(x)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(o_1)\\rangle,\\qquad|C|\\coloneqq|V|,\\qquad d(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{depth}(C^\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{out}_C(x)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(o_1)\\rangle,\\qquad|C|\\coloneqq|V|,\\qquad d(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{depth}(C^\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec m)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\ \\exists C\\in\\mathcal C_{n,\\vec m}\\ [|C|\\le(n+2)^c\\land d(C)\\le d\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle\\mathbf1[x\\in L]\\rangle]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec m)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\ \\exists C\\in\\mathcal C_{n,\\vec m}\\ [|C|\\le(n+2)^c\\land d(C)\\le d\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle\\mathbf1[x\\in L]\\rangle]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ACC}^0\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\ \\bigcup_{\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}^k}\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ACC}^0\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\ \\bigcup_{\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}^k}\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>MOD按书中约定在整除时输出0，避免与另一常见相反约定混淆。模数是族级固定常量，不能随n变化；k=0保留AC0子类。有限无环递归仍唯一。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 14.3；印刷页 291；PDF 页 317。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第14章的 Modular Gates and ACC0，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-depth","status":"resolved","id":"f62ab4c80ccedf7e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-depth]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\Gamma_n,\\operatorname{pred}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；$\\gamma_\\wedge=\\mathsf{and},\\gamma_\\vee=\\mathsf{or},\\gamma_\\neg=\\mathsf{not}$ 为其既有门标签；$\\mathsf M$ 是互异新增标签。$\\operatorname{depth}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-depth]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-depth","status":"resolved","id":"f62ab4c80ccedf7e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\Gamma_n,\\operatorname{pred}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；$\\gamma_\\wedge=\\mathsf{and},\\gamma_\\vee=\\mathsf{or},\\gamma_\\neg=\\mathsf{not}$ 为其既有门标签；$\\mathsf M$ 是互异新增标签。$\\operatorname{depth}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-depth]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"a_1,\\ldots,a_r\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec m=(m_1,\\ldots,m_k)","display":false},{"tex":"m_i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\Gamma_n,\\operatorname{pred}_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma_\\wedge=\\mathsf{and},\\gamma_\\vee=\\mathsf{or},\\gamma_\\neg=\\mathsf{not}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}","display":false},{"tex":"C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathcal C_{n,\\vec m}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MOD}_m(a_1,\\ldots,a_r)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1\\left[\\sum_{j=1}^ra_j\\not\\equiv0\\pmod m\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{n,\\vec m}\\coloneqq\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{(\\mathsf M,i):i\\in[k]\\},\\qquad\\kappa(t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\gamma_\\vee&t=(\\mathsf M,i),\\ i\\in[k],\\\\t&t\\in\\Gamma_n,\\end{cases}\\qquad C^\\kappa\\coloneqq(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\kappa\\circ\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_{n,\\vec m}\\coloneqq\\{C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau):\\tau:V\\to\\Gamma_{n,\\vec m},\\ C^\\kappa\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_j&\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j,\\\\b&\\tau(v)=b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\\\1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&\\tau(v)=\\gamma_\\neg,\\ \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\{u\\},\\\\\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&\\tau(v)=\\gamma_\\wedge,\\\\1-\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}(1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u))&\\tau(v)=\\gamma_\\vee,\\\\\\operatorname{MOD}_{m_i}((\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u))_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)})&\\tau(v)=(\\mathsf M,i).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_C(x)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(o_1)\\rangle,\\qquad|C|\\coloneqq|V|,\\qquad d(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{depth}(C^\\kappa).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec m)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\ \\exists C\\in\\mathcal C_{n,\\vec m}\\ [|C|\\le(n+2)^c\\land d(C)\\le d\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle\\mathbf1[x\\in L]\\rangle]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ACC}^0\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\ \\bigcup_{\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}^k}\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec m).","display":true}],"bytes":3382,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-346","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-mod-m-circuit]]、[[28-thm-razborov-smolensky]]、[[28-df-monotone-circuit]]、[[28-df-kw-relation]]、[[28-thm-kw-depth]]。"},{"id":"b8c5690725d651a3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p,q$ 为不同素数；$L_p=\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*:\\sum_i x_i\\not\\equiv0\\pmod p\\}$；$\\operatorname{ACC}^0(q)$ 使用 [[28-df-mod-m-circuit]]。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","f62ab4c80ccedf7e"]}